[
  {"id": "q_ei_01", "text": "在社交场合中，你通常会感到精力充沛而不是疲惫", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Fe", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_ei_02", "text": "你更享受独处时的思考时光，而非与人交谈", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Ti", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_ei_03", "text": "你倾向于先行动后思考，而不是反复权衡再行动", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Se", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_ei_04", "text": "在群体中你更愿意倾听而不是主导话题", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Fi", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_ei_05", "text": "与朋友聚会后，你需要独处来恢复精力", "dimension": "E/I", "function": null, "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_ei_06", "text": "你很容易与陌生人展开对话", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Fe", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_ei_07", "text": "你更喜欢通过书写来表达想法，而非口头交流", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Ti", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_ei_08", "text": "热闹的环境让你感到兴奋和充满活力", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Se", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},

  {"id": "q_sn_01", "text": "你更关注事物的细节和具体事实，而非宏观图景", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Si", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_sn_02", "text": "你常常沉浸在对未来的想象和可能性中", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ne", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_sn_03", "text": "对于抽象概念和理论，你感到兴趣浓厚", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ni", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_sn_04", "text": "你更依赖过往的经验来做决定，而非直觉", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Si", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_sn_05", "text": "当别人谈论宏大理论时，你更想知道实际怎么操作", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Te", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_sn_06", "text": "你喜欢头脑风暴各种新点子和可能性", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ne", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_sn_07", "text": "比起按照说明书一步步来，你更爱边做边摸索", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Se", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_sn_08", "text": "你经常思考事物的深层意义和内在联系", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ni", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},

  {"id": "q_tf_01", "text": "做决定时你更依赖逻辑分析而非个人感受", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Te", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_tf_02", "text": "你很容易感受到他人的情绪变化", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Fe", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_tf_03", "text": "你认为原则和公平比个人关系更重要", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Ti", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_tf_04", "text": "批评他人时你常常会担心伤害到对方的感受", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Fi", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_tf_05", "text": "你更欣赏逻辑清晰的人，而非情感丰富的人", "dimension": "T/F", "function": null, "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_tf_06", "text": "看到别人哭泣时，你也会不由自主地感到难过", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Fe", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_tf_07", "text": "当别人向你倾诉烦恼时，你首先想到的是解决问题的方法", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Te", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_tf_08", "text": "做决定时你会考虑这个决定对相关人情感上的影响", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Fi", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},

  {"id": "q_jp_01", "text": "你更喜欢有计划、有条理的生活，而非随性而为", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Te", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_jp_02", "text": "截止日期临近时的压力反而让你效率更高", "dimension": "J/P", "function": null, "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_jp_03", "text": "旅行前你会制定详细的行程计划", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Si", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_jp_04", "text": "你更喜欢保持选择的灵活性，不想过早锁定一个方案", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Ne", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_jp_05", "text": "完成一项任务后，你喜欢彻底收尾再开始下一项", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Te", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_jp_06", "text": "你的桌面或工作空间通常比较随性，不太追求整洁", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Se", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_jp_07", "text": "计划被打乱时你会感到明显的不适", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Si", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_jp_08", "text": "你倾向于边做边调整，而不是先制定完整计划", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Se", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},

  {"id": "q_fn_ti_01", "text": "你常常分析问题的内在逻辑，直到完全理解为止", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Ti", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_ti_02", "text": "你喜欢将复杂问题拆解为基本组成部分来理解", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Ti", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_te_01", "text": "你擅长组织资源和人员来高效完成任务", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Te", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_te_02", "text": "做决定前你更看重数据和事实而非直觉", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Te", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_fi_01", "text": "你有一套明确的个人价值观，并据此判断对错", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Fi", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_fi_02", "text": "你更重视做真实的自己，而非迎合外界的期待", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Fi", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_fe_01", "text": "维持群体和谐对你来说非常重要", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Fe", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_fe_02", "text": "你能自然地在不同社交场合中调整自己的行为方式", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Fe", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_si_01", "text": "回忆过去的经历能给你带来慰藉和指导", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Si", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_si_02", "text": "你注意细节，能回忆起过去事件中的具体画面和感受", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Si", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_se_01", "text": "你活在当下，善于捕捉周围环境的细微变化", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Se", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_se_02", "text": "你喜欢尝试新鲜刺激的体验，动手能力很强", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Se", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_ni_01", "text": "你常常突然领悟事物的深层真相，仿佛灵光一现", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ni", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_ni_02", "text": "你善于预见事物的发展趋势，并能从碎片信息中拼凑全局", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ni", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_ne_01", "text": "你能在不同事物之间看到常人看不到的联系", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ne", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_ne_02", "text": "当一个项目变得乏味，你会立刻被新的有趣想法吸引走", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Ne", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},

  {"id": "q_ac_01", "text": "这是一道注意力检测题，请选择「非常同意」", "dimension": "E/I", "function": null, "weight": "core", "reversed": false, "attentionCheck": {"requiredAnswer": 5}},
  {"id": "q_ac_02", "text": "请选择「不同意」以确认你在认真作答", "dimension": "S/N", "function": null, "weight": "core", "reversed": false, "attentionCheck": {"requiredAnswer": 2}},
  {"id": "q_ac_03", "text": "本题为检测题，请选择「非常不同意」", "dimension": "T/F", "function": null, "weight": "core", "reversed": false, "attentionCheck": {"requiredAnswer": 1}},

  {"id": "q_dup_ei_01", "text": "人多的时候你更容易感到疲劳而非兴奋", "dimension": "E/I", "function": null, "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_dup_ei_02", "text": "在社交活动结束后，你会感到身心俱疲", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Fe", "weight": "core", "reversed": true, "duplicateOf": "q_dup_ei_01"},
  {"id": "q_dup_sn_01", "text": "抽象的理论和概念让你着迷", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ni", "weight": "core", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_dup_sn_02", "text": "你喜欢花时间思考那些没有标准答案的哲学问题", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ni", "weight": "core", "reversed": true, "duplicateOf": "q_dup_sn_01"},
  {"id": "q_dup_tf_01", "text": "做决定时你优先考虑公平和一致性", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Te", "weight": "core", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_dup_tf_02", "text": "即使可能伤害某些人的感受，你也会坚持客观公正的决定", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Ti", "weight": "core", "reversed": false, "duplicateOf": "q_dup_tf_01"},

  {"id": "q_ei_09", "text": "在团队讨论中，你通常是发言最多的人之一", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Fe", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_ei_10", "text": "比起广泛社交，你更看重少数深刻的友谊", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Fi", "weight": "extended", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_ei_11", "text": "独自工作时你的效率比团队合作更高", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Ti", "weight": "extended", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_ei_12", "text": "遇到问题时你第一反应是找人讨论而非自己思考", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Fe", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},

  {"id": "q_sn_09", "text": "你更重视现实世界的实际经验，而非书本上的理论", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Se", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_sn_10", "text": "你常常沉迷于天马行空的幻想和假设", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ne", "weight": "extended", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_sn_11", "text": "你相信眼见为实，不太相信第六感", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Se", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_sn_12", "text": "你总能从看似无关的事物中发现隐藏的模式", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ni", "weight": "extended", "reversed": true},

  {"id": "q_tf_09", "text": "当逻辑和情感冲突时，你几乎总是选择逻辑", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Ti", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_tf_10", "text": "你愿意为了照顾他人感受而牺牲效率", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Fe", "weight": "extended", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_tf_11", "text": "别人觉得你有时候太理性、不近人情", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Te", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_tf_12", "text": "你对自己的情绪变化有清晰的觉察", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Fi", "weight": "extended", "reversed": true},

  {"id": "q_jp_09", "text": "你对日程和计划有较强的掌控欲", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Te", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_jp_10", "text": "你把截止日期看作建议而非硬性规定", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Ne", "weight": "extended", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_jp_11", "text": "你倾向于一次只专注一件事直到完成", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Si", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_jp_12", "text": "你经常同时进行多个项目，在它们之间来回切换", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Se", "weight": "extended", "reversed": true},

  {"id": "q_fn_ti_03", "text": "你经常在心里构建逻辑框架来理解复杂问题", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Ti", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_te_03", "text": "你善于制定可量化的目标和执行步骤", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Te", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_fi_03", "text": "有些事物你会出于个人信念而拒绝妥协", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Fi", "weight": "extended", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_fe_03", "text": "群体气氛不对时你能立刻察觉并试图调和", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Fe", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_si_03", "text": "你依赖经过验证的方法和传统，不喜欢冒险尝试", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Si", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_se_03", "text": "你享受感官刺激，比如美食、音乐和运动", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Se", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_ni_03", "text": "你常常在脑海中模拟未来的多种可能性", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ni", "weight": "extended", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_ne_03", "text": "你对新鲜事物充满好奇，容易被新想法点燃热情", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Ne", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},

  {"id": "q_deep_ei_01", "text": "经过一整天的社交活动后，你不仅不累反而更兴奋", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Fe", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_deep_ei_02", "text": "你更愿意用文字沟通而非面对面交谈，因为可以更精确地表达", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Ti", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_deep_ei_03", "text": "在聚会上你会主动把安静的人拉入对话", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Fe", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_deep_ei_04", "text": "独自旅行对你来说比结伴旅行更有吸引力", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Fi", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},

  {"id": "q_deep_sn_01", "text": "你常常陷入对人生意义的深度思考", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ni", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_deep_sn_02", "text": "描述一棵树时，你会先说它的高度和形状而非它在生态系统中的角色", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Si", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_deep_sn_03", "text": "你更相信科学方法和数据，而非直觉感应", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Te", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_deep_sn_04", "text": "你经常产生强烈的预感，而且后来证明是正确的", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ni", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},

  {"id": "q_deep_tf_01", "text": "当规则伤害到具体的人时，你认为规则应该被打破", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Fi", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_deep_tf_02", "text": "你认为同情心有时会阻碍人们做出正确的决定", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Te", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_deep_tf_03", "text": "你能够很自然地体会到别人的痛苦，仿佛自己亲身经历", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Fe", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_deep_tf_04", "text": "在激烈的争论中，你更关心谁说得对而不是谁的感受受伤害", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Ti", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},

  {"id": "q_deep_jp_01", "text": "整理和分类物品能给你带来心理上的满足感", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Si", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_deep_jp_02", "text": "计划好的事情突然变更，你可以毫不费力地调整心态", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Se", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_deep_jp_03", "text": "出门旅行你更喜欢有一个大致的框架而不是精确到小时的行程", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Ne", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_deep_jp_04", "text": "你很难理解为什么有人做事毫无计划性", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Te", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},

  {"id": "q_fn_ti_04", "text": "你追求思维的内在一致性，讨厌自相矛盾的观点", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Ti", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_ti_05", "text": "你常常质疑权威和传统，除非他们能用逻辑说服你", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Ti", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_te_04", "text": "你相信效率是最重要的衡量标准", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Te", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_te_05", "text": "面对混乱的局面，你会本能地开始组织和管理", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Te", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_fi_04", "text": "你很难做违背自己价值观的事，即使有巨大的外部压力", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Fi", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_fi_05", "text": "你对艺术作品的好坏有强烈的主观判断", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Fi", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_fe_04", "text": "你的情绪很容易被周围人的情绪感染", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Fe", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_fe_05", "text": "你宁愿自己受委屈也不愿让群体关系破裂", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Fe", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_si_04", "text": "你清楚地记得过去重要事件的具体细节和顺序", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Si", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_si_05", "text": "你喜欢例行公事和稳定的节奏，变化让你不安", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Si", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_se_04", "text": "你擅长即兴发挥，不喜欢过度准备", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Se", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_se_05", "text": "你常常注意到别人忽略的视觉或听觉细节", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Se", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_ni_04", "text": "你能在复杂的局面中快速抓住本质", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ni", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_ni_05", "text": "你常常觉得别人看不懂你认为很明显的事物走向", "dimension": "S/N", "function": "Ni", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_ne_04", "text": "你经常从一个兴趣跳到另一个兴趣，每个都浅尝辄止", "dimension": "J/P", "function": "Ne", "weight": "deep", "reversed": true},
  {"id": "q_fn_ne_05", "text": "创意思考时你产出的点子数量远超一般人", "dimension": "E/I", "function": "Ne", "weight": "deep", "reversed": false},

  {"id": "q_fn_ti_06", "text": "你喜欢给事物分类并建立清晰的知识体系", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Ti", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},
  {"id": "q_fn_te_06", "text": "你会本能地计算事情的投入产出比", "dimension": "T/F", "function": "Te", "weight": "extended", "reversed": false},
